  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nabadoon People-to-People Reconciliation Activity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">(Somalia):  .With FY 2024 resources, USAID will promote nonviolent conflict mitigation and reconciliation at the local level in southern Somalia. Using people-to-people peacebuilding approaches in partnership with local civil society organizations, USAID will encourage greater social and economic integration between conflicting clans, including those from historically marginalized communities, and address unresolved grievances that drive communities towards al-Shabaab.  With FY 2024 resources, USAID will strengthen economic interdependence between conflicting groups through joint livelihood activities and improved natural resource management. Nabadoon coordinates closely with USAID stabilization and governance efforts to address conflict and facilitate engagement between government and citizens. ...</narrative>
  </description>
